{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527080/extras/fef968dfb09c0fdcdc996e748085f61c.avif?t=1764157782\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal streamer &quot;Spooky&quot; Symon stumbles upon an obscure urban legend known only as the &quot;Phantom Incident&quot;.</strong>\u00a0Seeing this as a perfect scoop for his social media, Symon jumps at the opportunity to bring new light to the story and gain more followers in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527080/extras/1d75ef62f73e081c44a936651df4e17b.avif?t=1764157782\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Sparse County, talk to locals, solve puzzles and make footage.</strong> Collect evidence to help your investigation and effect the conclusion of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527080/extras/c9ce550a5ab4b7f11856cce162d50edc.avif?t=1764157782\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An online streamer themed horror game (45-60 minutes) with multiple endings and non-linear progression.</strong> Low poly themed. Fully voice acted with sub-titles (English).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shopaholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/628649112c2480a44688f16252f3ec723a79c6e1.jpg"},{"name":"Cone Crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/d80046a710c0666efd00fb260ba768bca05cc038.jpg"},{"name":"Light Bringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st